{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20034","headline":"抒情因上郎中二十二叔监察十五叔兼呈李益端公柳缜评事 · 孟郊","name":"抒情因上郎中二十二叔监察十五叔兼呈李益端公柳缜评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"方凭指下弦，写出心中言。\n寸草贱子命，高山主人恩。\n游边风沙意，梦楚波涛魂。\n一日引别袂，九回沾泪痕。\n自悲何以然，在礼阙晨昏。\n名利时转甚，是非宵亦喧。\n浮情少定主，百虑随世翻。\n举此胸臆恨，幸从贤哲论。\n明明三飞鸾，照物如朝暾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}